        '> TACNET FIELD TERMINAL v6.2',
        '> AUTHENTICATING PILOT CLEARANCE... OK',
        '> LOADING THEATER MAP DATA...',
        '> SATELLITE UPLINK... ESTABLISHED',
        '> RENDERING OPERATIONS OVERLAY...',
        '> STANDBY.',
